# 'solve' set 'lim.initialized' without initalizing 'lim.elim', 'lim.inprobe',
# 'lim.compact', 'lim.condition'.
# Fixed by a separate 'lim.preprocessing_initialized' flag.  Expected
# 'stats': 1 conflict and no 'inprobingphases' (as without 'propagate').
